# LeanearizedODEs

The computer-assisted proofs of the book (`../book_radii_polynomials/`), checked in Lean with the
library `RadiiPolynomial`: one file per chapter (`LeanearizedODEs/ChNN.lean`), with the certificate
data generated from the JSON certificates (`LeanearizedODEs/Data/ChNN.lean`,
`scripts/json_to_lean.py`). `BOOK_MAP.md` maps the results of the book to Lean declarations.
